<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allerhand</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ursachen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dormaln</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kheinen</unclear> völligen gloub-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> gäben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">könen</unclear>: So habend wir by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetzt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">für</unclear>-
